Summary of modifications (details in the git history and docs/):
- Removed Firebase Analytics and Cloud Messaging, ML Kit GenAI / AICore,
  Google Play services TFLite and oss-licenses, scheduled notifications and
  the boot receiver.
- Replaced MediaPipe's usage-stats uploader (Firebase datatransport) with the
  no-op telemetry-stub module.
- The model list is bundled with the app and fetched only on request.
- Added a build-time privacy guard, a static licenses screen, a "ci" build
  type, and the Phone Agent feature (package
  com.google.ai.edge.gallery.phoneagent).
Upstream source files changed by this fork are marked with "PhoneAgent"
comments.

Third-party libraries and their licenses are listed in the app under
Settings > Third-party libraries, generated from
Android/src/app/src/main/assets/phoneagent/third_party_licenses.tsv.
